OL,3,AFive ways the Budget will affect you if
OL,4,Ayou are under 25
OL,5,
OL,6,FTax and spending decisions by the
OL,7,Fgovernment may feel distant to your
OL,8,Feveryday life, but many of the Budget
OL,9,Fannouncements will have a direct impact
OL,10,Fon you and your money.
OL,12,FHere are five ways the Budget will
OL,13,Faffect you if you are under-25.
OL,15,FIf you are an 18-to-20 year-old earning
OL,16,Fthe minimum wage, your pay will go up
OL,17,Fby 3.9% from next April.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
