OL,3,AFive ways the Budget will affect you if
OL,4,Ayou are under 25
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite the increase, this may be a
OL,7,Flower rise than you had expected. That
OL,8,Fis because Healey reversed course on
OL,9,Fhow his Labour predecessor, Rachel
OL,10,FReeves, had been uprating the minimum
OL,11,Fwage for young people.
